    "section_press_7PT3DY": {
      "type": "section-press",
      "blocks": {
        "press_LWtgfa": {
          "type": "press",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Just go my truck back from Premier tire and the new Rims and tires look awesome they were great to deal with from order to delivery i would recommend them to be your tire place.</p>",
            "link": "",
            "press_title": "JOHN PALMATEER",
            "logo_width": 70
          }
        },
        "press_7TqJp3": {
          "type": "press",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>I had an outstanding experience with Premier Rims. After finding cracks in my new rims, Zsolt and Carmen went above and beyond to resolve the issue, offering two replacement options without any hassle. Their customer service is truly exceptional. Highly recommend Premier Rims to everyone!</p>",
            "link": "",
            "press_title": "SARA",
            "logo_width": 70
          }
        },
        "press_PqwL7V": {
          "type": "press",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Premier Rims went above and beyond to resolve an issue with my rims — no hassle, just real commitment to customer service. Highly recommend them for their honesty and professionalism.</p>",
            "link": "",
            "press_title": "CARMEN MOUSHIKH",
            "logo_width": 70
          }
        },
        "press_yiN9kR": {
          "type": "press",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Always quick, always reliable. My go-to place for any tire needs. The staff is friendly, knowledgeable, and they always make sure I leave feeling confident about my vehicle. Whether it’s a quick fix, a tire replacement, or seasonal changeover, they get it done efficiently and professionally. I wouldn’t trust anyone else with my wheels.</p>",
            "link": "",
            "press_title": "TOM LOUGHRAN",
            "logo_width": 70
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "press_LWtgfa",
        "press_7TqJp3",
        "press_PqwL7V",
        "press_yiN9kR"
      ],
      "name": "Press/Logo",
