    "section_accordions_with_images_yKBCnJ": {
      "type": "section-accordions-with-images",
      "blocks": {
        "text_LVjrUm": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "We Provide Affordable Tires!",
            "text": "<p>Driven by the thirst to satisfy our customers, our entire existence is focused on saving you money and providing the absolute value you deserve. Don’t believe us? Give us a try and find out for yourself. We are confident that our pricing, combined with our unparalleled service, is the right fit for your needs.</p>",
            "icon_image": "shopify://shop_images/home-banner-why33.webp",
            "icon_width": 100,
            "icon_position": "inline-left"
          }
        },
        "text_xLcp4B": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "We Provide Affordable Tires!",
            "text": "<p>Driven by the thirst to satisfy our customers, our entire existence is focused on saving you money and providing the absolute value you deserve. Don’t believe us? Give us a try and find out for yourself. We are confident that our pricing, combined with our unparalleled service, is the right fit for your needs.</p>",
            "icon_image": "shopify://shop_images/home-banner-why33.webp",
            "icon_width": 100,
            "icon_position": "inline-left"
          }
        },
        "text_HMThH4": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "We Offer Huge Discounts!",
            "text": "<p>By working directly with manufacturers and having strong relationships with tire companies, we’re able to offer high discounts. We even offer additional discounts when you choose to purchase wheel and tire packages! We proudly display the amount of money you’ll save when choosing to buy through onlinetires.com. Browse through your favorite brands and see for yourself: We can meet your needs at prices that our competitors simply cannot match.</p>",
            "icon_image": "shopify://shop_images/home-banner-why33.webp",
            "icon_width": 100,
            "icon_position": "inline-left"
          }
        },
        "text_QFXRBQ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "We Have the Lowest Tire Prices!",
            "text": "<p>At premiertire.ca, we’re here for you. Our goal is to match your vehicle with the best tire brand at the lowest cost. We don’t deal with middlemen; we work directly with manufacturers to ensure that you don’t overpay for a quality tire that is built to last. We work hard so you don’t have to! You can browse through our selection with confidence because you are shopping at the lowest possible price on the web.</p>",
            "icon_image": "shopify://shop_images/home-banner-why33.webp",
            "icon_width": 100,
            "icon_position": "inline-left"
          }
        }
      },
